<title>USA: US WATS names Chris Shannon CFO.</title>
<headline>US WATS names Chris Shannon CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BALA CYNWYD, Pa. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>US WATS Inc said Tuesday it appointed Mark Mendes as its chief operating officer, and Chris Shannon as its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Prior to joining US WATS, Mendes served as vice president, service and technology for ACCESS Teleconferencing International.</p>
<p>Shannon was formerly director of business development for Teleglobe International.</p>
</text>
